coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder organizations create [flags] <organization name>

  Create a new organization.

OPTIONS:
      --default-org-member-roles string-array
          Roles granted to every member of the organization. Accepts a
          comma-separated list and may be repeated. Defaults to
          organization-workspace-access. Pass an empty value
          (--default-org-member-roles="") to grant no roles.

  -y, --yes bool
          Bypass confirmation prompts.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
